## Warning
The keys stored in this directory are intended for development and testing
purposes only and must not be used in production environments. Using these
keys for mass production can introduce significant security vulnerabilities.

## Test Keys Replacement Required
Please be aware that all keys within this directory serve as templates or
examples only. It is imperative that you replace them with your own secure
keys before deploying any application to a production environment. Failure
to do so may compromise the security of your application.
